    "figma.propMap": "Maps Figma variant/property values -> designmd variant classes, e.g. {\"Variant\":{\"Primary\":\"btn-primary\"}}.",
    "react.block": "Cross-reference to the React/Storybook library (Picasso). Fields: component, import, storyId, status, propMap, note.",
